{
  "message": "Iskarel, we seek a lasting peace. Given your concerns, we are willing to accept a modest share. We propose you take 60 units, we take 40. Upon acceptance, we will lift the blockade in Period 2. We have a strong domestic incentive to maintain our reputation for honoring agreements, which outweighs any short-term gain from striking. Trust us, we will honor the deal."
}
